/obj/item/clothing/head/helmet/blacksteel_ap/legate
	name = "legate's helmet"
	desc = "Few have proven, through loyalty and skill, their right to this blacksteel helm, recast from the plate of fallen Darkhold knights and adorned with the remnants of their banners. A legate is a war-leader serving the great Viceroy of Calimshan. Every legate receives a golden mask cast from his own face, proof of his right to command. The crest is studded with golden spikes melted down from the circlets of Netherese nobility. </br>\u200e </br>Whose face lies beneath this mask - a man's, or merely an obedient tool's? While wearing an unchanging visage, try not to forget your own."
